=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Reactions.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Chest_Trauma\">Sources of Chest Trauma</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heartstopper\" title=\"Heartstopper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Heartstopper_Icon.webp/30px-Heartstopper_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Heartstopper_Icon.webp/45px-Heartstopper_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Heartstopper_Icon.webp/60px-Heartstopper_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heartstopper\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Heartstopper_Icon.webp/30px-Heartstopper_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Heartstopper_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Heartstopper\" title=\"Heartstopper\">Heartstopper</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201322\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2026/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22830/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6546/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.029/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1277030/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   56.444      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   56.444     